# Deploy-test agent SOP

Run all playbooks from the `ansible/` directory.

## Default hosts

| Target | Inventory host | IP |
|--------|----------------|-----|
| gnome-kiosk | `rhel10` | 192.168.122.81 |
| gnome-shell | `rhel10-atop` | 192.168.122.111 |

Always pass `-l <host>` so deploy does not hit both groups.

## After code changes

| What changed | Command |
|--------------|---------|
| `src/**` (kiosk build) | `ansible-playbook playbook-deploy.yml -l rhel10 -e deploy_component=app -e deploy_target=kiosk` |
| `src/**` (shell build) | `ansible-playbook playbook-deploy.yml -l rhel10-atop -e deploy_component=app -e deploy_target=shell` |
| `gnome-shell-extension/**` | `ansible-playbook playbook-deploy.yml -l rhel10-atop -e deploy_component=extension -e deploy_target=shell -e deploy_skip_build=true` |
| Role templates, systemd units, dconf, GDM | Full provision: `playbook-gnome-kiosk.yml` or `playbook-gnome-shell.yml` |

## Verify after every deploy

```bash
ansible-playbook playbook-verify.yml -l rhel10        # kiosk
ansible-playbook playbook-verify.yml -l rhel10-atop   # shell
```

## Restart vs reboot

- Fast deploy (`playbook-deploy.yml`): hybrid restart by default (systemd/pkill handlers). No reboot.
- Force reboot: add `-e deploy_reboot=true`
- Full provision playbooks always reboot.

## On failure

1. Re-run with `-vv`
2. For shell: check `journalctl --user -M kioskusr@ -u gnomekiosk-demo-shell.service`
3. Confirm D-Bus Ping returns `kiosk-layout-helper/1`

## Manual visual check (RDP)

```bash
xfreerdp /v:<vm-ip> /u:kioskusr /p:welcome1
```

Verify menu bar, radar background, minimize/restore, SAVE/LOAD/RESET.

## Collections

Install once: `ansible-galaxy collection install -r requirements.yml`
